"gitch doesn't know which account this repository uses. Lock it with gitch use <account>." = "gitch tidak tahu akun mana yang dipakai repositori ini. Kunci dengan gitch use <akun>.";
"gitch found nothing to draw for %@." = "gitch tidak menemukan apa pun untuk digambar pada %1$@.";
"gitch graph changes: files that are often committed together, and how often each one changes." = "gitch graph changes: file yang sering di-commit bersama, dan seberapa sering tiap file berubah.";
"gitch graph check reads its rules from .gitch/graph.rules in this repository. Create the file with commented-out examples (gitch graph check --init) and open it?" = "gitch graph check membaca aturan dari .gitch/graph.rules di repositori ini. Buat file berisi contoh yang dijadikan komentar (gitch graph check --init) lalu buka?";
"gitch graph diff files: imports added and removed on this branch, and cycles that appeared, grew, shrank or went away." = "gitch graph diff files: import yang ditambahkan dan dihapus di branch ini, serta siklus yang muncul, membesar, mengecil, atau hilang.";
"gitch graph diff modules: module dependencies added and removed on this branch." = "gitch graph diff modules: dependensi modul yang ditambahkan dan dihapus di branch ini.";
"gitch graph diff tree: folders whose number of files or size changed on this branch." = "gitch graph diff tree: folder yang jumlah file atau ukurannya berubah di branch ini.";
"gitch graph files: which file imports which, for TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust, Kotlin and Java. Swift files are linked by the type names they use (dashed lines)." = "gitch graph files: file mana yang mengimpor file mana, untuk TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust, Kotlin, dan Java. File Swift dihubungkan lewat nama tipe yang dipakainya (garis putus-putus).";
"gitch graph modules: targets and packages from Package.swift, Tuist, package.json, Cargo, Go and Gradle. Reading Package.swift takes a few seconds." = "gitch graph modules: target dan paket dari Package.swift, Tuist, package.json, Cargo, Go, dan Gradle. Membaca Package.swift butuh beberapa detik.";
"gitch graph tree: folders with their size and number of files." = "gitch graph tree: folder beserta ukuran dan jumlah file-nya.";
"gitch keeps several Git accounts apart: it locks each repository to an account, picks the account by folder or organization, and blocks wrong authors, secrets and force pushes in git hooks, in the terminal, for AI agents and in Gitrochi." = "gitch memisahkan beberapa akun Git: mengunci setiap repositori ke satu akun, memilih akun berdasarkan aturan folder atau organisasi, dan memblokir penulis yang salah, rahasia, serta force push lewat hook Git, di terminal, untuk agen AI, dan di Gitrochi.";
"gitch saves a backup before pull, up, sync, fix, undo and amend, and keeps the 30 most recent." = "gitch menyimpan cadangan sebelum pull, up, sync, fix, undo, dan amend, dan menyimpan 30 yang terbaru.";
"gitch sets the commit author to %@ and points origin (and upstream) at %@'s SSH alias, then locks the repository to it." = "gitch menetapkan penulis commit ke %1$@, mengarahkan origin (dan upstream) ke alias SSH %2$@, lalu mengunci repositori ke akun itu.";
"gitch stops requiring %@ for commits and pushes here. The commit author stays as it is." = "gitch tidak lagi mewajibkan %1$@ untuk commit dan push di sini. Penulis commit tetap sama.";
"gitch sync: brings this branch up to date with the original repository (upstream)." = "gitch sync: menyamakan branch ini dengan repositori asli (upstream).";
"gitch up: moves this branch onto the latest default branch, or merges it if the branch is already pushed. A backup is saved first." = "gitch up: memindahkan branch ini ke atas branch bawaan terbaru, atau menggabungkannya jika branch sudah di-push. Cadangan disimpan lebih dulu.";
"gitch won't check authors, secrets or pushes in this repository until you turn it back on." = "gitch tidak akan memeriksa penulis, rahasia, atau push di repositori ini sampai Anda menyalakannya lagi.";
